

                        IMPORTANT  !

This version of xtetra is runable Both as Xenolinkdoor and Clidoor.

To know in which mode to run xtetra looks at the name by which
it was started.

When the name starts with a 'c' or 'C' it runs as a CLIdoor
else it wil run as a Xenolinkdoor.

So rename Xtetra to Ctetra when you want to run it as a CLIdoor.

Look in the TETRIS.DOC for more information !





No more confusing file not found messages in CLI !

By typing ! or ? in de main menu of Xtetra you get debugging

information in CLI about files that are not found !.


